<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 16/17.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 16/17.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday</p>
<p>set the following exchange rates for July 16/17. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>		   July 16/17	July 15/16</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42019	    0.42269</p>
<p>    DKK    2.0985	     2.10028</p>
<p>    FIM    2.70355	    2.70566</p>
<p>    GBP   24.0811	    24.21841</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07468	    0.07474</p>
<p>    LTL    3.58782	    3.58815</p>
<p>    LVL   24.92278	   25.13055</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00248	    0.00248</p>
<p>    SEK    1.82847	    1.85172</p>
<p>    UAH    7.73162	    7.73107</p>
<p>    USD   14.3468	    14.3508</p>
<p>    XEU   15.79224	   15.90786</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
